WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.492
Unit nineteen. Making Plans!

2
00:00:04.507 --> 00:00:12.970
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.225
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.275 --> 00:00:20.800
Today we learn: Making Plans. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.333
Plan. Say it with me. Plan!

6
00:00:28.827 --> 00:00:32.527
Meet. Say it with me. Meet!

7
00:00:36.027 --> 00:00:39.694
Tomorrow. Say it with me. Tomorrow!

8
00:00:43.198 --> 00:00:46.914
Later. Say it with me. Later!

9
00:00:50.497 --> 00:00:54.430
Schedule. Say it with me. Schedule!

10
00:00:57.847 --> 00:01:01.180
Busy. Say it with me. Busy!

11
00:01:04.675 --> 00:01:08.008
Free. Say it with me. Free!

12
00:01:11.565 --> 00:01:15.548
Arrange. Say it with me. Arrange!

13
00:01:19.002 --> 00:01:27.338
Grammar time! Future with 'going to'. Listen. We are going to meet tomorrow.

14
00:01:27.388 --> 00:01:32.059
Your turn. Say it with me. We are going to meet tomorrow.

15
00:01:37.015 --> 00:01:44.951
Let's make a plan to meet tomorrow. I am busy today, but I am free later. We can arrange a good time on the schedule.

16
00:01:45.001 --> 00:01:46.402
I like this story!

17
00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:52.657
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:52.707 --> 00:01:53.857
Tomorrow!

19
00:01:54.797 --> 00:01:59.966
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:00.016 --> 00:02:01.166
Free!

21
00:02:02.116 --> 00:02:09.941
Think and answer. What plans do you have for tomorrow?

22
00:02:09.991 --> 00:02:11.141
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.138 --> 00:02:14.394
This unit's value is Planning.

24
00:02:14.444 --> 00:02:16.511
I can show planning every day!

25
00:02:17.335 --> 00:02:24.885
Congratulations, everyone! You finished the Beginner level. See you in Elementary. Goodbye!

26
00:02:24.935 --> 00:02:28.400
Thank you, Teacher Chanthy! See you in Elementary!

